# Uploads to Vercel (the three projects deploy from this repository): leave out local-only files.
.local
# Claude Code's own folders (session worktrees, each a full copy of the repo: hundreds of MB that no build uses)
.claude
.agents
**/node_modules
**/.next
dist
test-results*
playwright-report*
deploy/backups
deploy/backup-config
deploy/.env
**/.env.local
docs/screenshots
# The shop's own notes (shop/README.md, shop/REBUILD-PLAN.md) are for the team, not the public site. shop/CREDITS.md
# (the photo credits) stays public. The shop is uploaded from here, so its folder's own .vercelignore alone is not enough.
shop/README.md
shop/REBUILD-PLAN.md
